      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "e10f1eeb5e53030936a42fd83c5d4e196b50bc0e60af20a4839c3e87e9720c6f",
      "text": "Next lesson",
      "hash": "d0ae2a13d8665949dd104a2fbdedcc8bca3e647a1e131d1ebaeb31c189a553b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "07ad771cf11a6bb2c8dab1254424a6246ed49116a368429e6646d1d3b704bebf",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f6ebc09c9cc3e02e705ae39a67805341dcfa9105cc90632ab44e92ec08ba8ca",
      "text": "Do You Need To Deploy The AI SDK To Vercel?",
      "hash": "220e576d6e60a92d3f64c3943f7c77cffdaa5664b71c9285a844648231e3cc5a"
    },
    {
      "id": "48b02631579d774a41904e9522cf4d1e5ad6ad4673d33c5531bccf6955a867c7",
      "text": "What Are The Different Parts Of The AI SDK?",
      "hash": "3943185f039fc9d5903b783730706f5c90853e3c396913ba634f38a0e59d9d30"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f85b665cf81bca7c98e72ef744752bdfb5667c40c2c422e383f9e2ba052b301",
      "text": "What Can You Build With The AI SDK?",
      "hash": "29c6b0195ccf0551d97ad26ddd50501a1442dfd3e70e672acda59a85f36f17be"
    },
    {
      "id": "f11b7a295f2199a99158d556b3f87e9a2db00481dcce534d6935a6566926c447",
      "text": "What Does This Tutorial Cover?",
      "hash": "29da7e6d76db9a2d28a856d5e524a994fc48e37e80f517ea5557cc236742ec1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "efa36e2e01fd5aae1ceeceaff816135afa6a985a3063da6f7187e6776a51a0bf",
      "text": "How Do You Install It?",
      "hash": "73a355bfdb9b1a9b537932e3573e22cbec9772caf98fa3c736429055463f1856"
    },
    {
      "id": "5af1642e43381530db7b2e91401e7f4ad83428d41877c51f84595f3f3db8d879",
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "hash": "89db2ad881f29c18b305a20c8ed7bdffdfde49d633c27a83bd204bf9cfedaba3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0fc38b7eca6b1621fb2a3172ac696cc8dbca671a901cf2de490e580de8b5dc5f",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef9a38ef197a73183b01048e432c6f1029631ea339e7bc268fb212cc13e43b3c",
      "text": "There's a pretty common problem when you're building AI-powered apps.",
      "hash": "0555b079dc0015659c72f32485d973b6a6fecb1f76e735c133002288284e973f"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbfec04c20c75c6fc3fea4e59dbc0e3159eb42049307558bd872e1adb5703bcb",
      "text": "Let's say you're using OpenAI as your LLM provider.",
      "hash": "1600263b61d0f080f4031bb52d1f4dc0639e16c827ffbaaeb80eb60f17d54c22"
    },
    {
      "id": "77e0b1d0010afcd30dc2234db475082a6a1d6fe530c73baa0e7345e220b6c695",
      "text": "You build all of this code to talk to OpenAI's API.",
      "hash": "5e0acf700d4c4771e11703c0e78d747a34eeba6761ff31be32689610e0f31dae"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc03723ad10eb2964d27279075bf0294b6aabf441d17009394f9bd8b6e677625",
      "text": "But then one day you think, \"Oh, why don't we try Anthropic instead?\"",
      "hash": "d6320b106b5292701557f172689ec90319de6a2b7da4e45bdf65534cc02a47df"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f2452db7645dc2eab2c8c0b25187fdeec2c0b6e67ff2c7380068650712081dc",
      "text": "But there's a problem: Anthropic's API is a little bit different.",
      "hash": "7f0dfab8970553f8363a714404b071a9007bdff20661d4bb4c1399f103fcfd34"
    },
    {
      "id": "714a552eb5d5323ba5cafcc340944fdef4005df2b49da9032b9920f38234d274",
      "text": "This is especially true for things like streaming, structured outputs, and tool calling.",
      "hash": "44bdc7c859f5c39c74c298cafe04cd292de6096d7f10736f0dcf1fb359ee32f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "24f4a1b432444036f88c1d6a6a28f479427e69a75c0722a2ede50a2793ae889e",
      "text": "So you need to build all of this extra glue code just to try out a new model.",
      "hash": "1b0da67bda8cde8a2efd1e3e225759539124ce39e0222e9893fe17377b1e536e"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ad7fcab276d0946b2920cb5b3f80ed5dd913144815d19cf554fd6462841dc6a",
      "text": "The AI SDK lets you handle that.",
      "hash": "3404740978d8925e770b61c7b6cddee5cce491e396dc55e51b07ca2d30faa9b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4bf5bc242bfc0d879e3039e4fcf32f93999f4326fed77fc0074dbf85ff562ab",
      "text": "It's a library that you can call, which handles the interaction between you and the LLM.",
      "hash": "68ad25491f966f81fa1ace81ade09f4259a476d59d7f49b91abb6841d8ff1478"
    },
    {
      "id": "a360167c445b02d62d8bf6ec96f5f05c6876f75fec657f1a002263d4c8f09584",
      "text": "So now you can call the AI SDK instead, which is just a library, and it will seamlessly handle talking to different providers.",
      "hash": "8fff4837e2cb0b90d5b65cbe4e0248284ac98a1f7f2a6f238d74e05e17c84491"
    },
    {
      "id": "cf7375236517c10084983be1095c3f45b0cfd9343f2d7734f71fc19217270903",
      "text": "Not only that, but it has some really nice helpers for common use cases.",
      "hash": "47ce89315ff2217ffe45b93cb4ba5b6e9ad001214dd56e59ce0519620000bb87"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e593241f5b000b9f755c658d635c786ed996388aaef3e1cb95bde25a1d1ccef",
      "text": "It helps you stream text, work with structured outputs, do tool calling, and even handle agents seamlessly.",
      "hash": "a0d0fa89a2b7d4196d89d278ac21efb2735326feafda0d0d15b0d15a31a56d0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "adb684af7c0440ca67ef31bff5e5c066a20e691fc90752515363406bf06d3177",
      "text": "The AI SDK is maintained by Vercel. But you don't need to use Vercel in order to use the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "e0e5e89c65645ceeeb920f3520220e56373d790167f13eae143e5aa16ed539fd"
    },
    {
      "id": "de942e2b97a12400edb7fcf2286786b3607b2a4ceec004160a04b47d53bf6ce2",
      "text": "You don't need to pay Vercel any money - it's free, open-source software.",
      "hash": "bb16b65933528e9866f60a4dde48c1a4dcf4bb12f99ba1520521079d16667c57"
    },
    {
      "id": "987e6881aef561441d047c2b5b65433321f50780b63a090150d73238fa08eb9c",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "13013b6dc19d774ccea365d37f2ae9883424b554fc41e196cf77b53edf9a7ee2",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "05210c208a100d4dc7a1f90f45dcf4cace1ea2e1a6327d1edac1e5c5d31f2240",
      "text": "There are three different parts of the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "17a0fd20b75cdd7d9a8d07d604addc698556305705bcb82ef002cdbe53a3a1fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "c35a5dcf7d23699ad76bda79285ffa8934e96676f7e6333f47b034bdbb6473ee",
      "text": "You have the AI SDK Core which is used for backend, so Node, Deno, Bun, whatever.",
      "hash": "c6cd2d502256f2089cc6cad5b10ff0fc09bbf82e7c8484aa017e269d481ae0c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff45abcee16620abff733accd04da6769e46c2b28c6704ae99ae321df89b4f5d",
      "text": "You also have the AI SDK UI which is a set of front-end hooks and components for linking up to an AI SDK backend.",
      "hash": "3bbd7c1bf686566e3a9a7181ce6bcb29c5d0924b3aff4d0551b47295fe4f401f"
    },
    {
      "id": "68369e81e3082e4c73a7ac37118d0e569bb62a108318fd6ab07e3c30e059f6c1",
      "text": "There's also an AI SDK RSC framework, for building with React Server Components.",
      "hash": "ef573aa045eca923bc7a1972073f15051224d2bb4cacdb164db0dfcbc3eb263c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2d3a61d4c5cf3bb9b9c67a6ba8e14eb3b233ecbaf886c76b7e56002582ed1f0",
      "text": "The AI SDK is useful when your app needs to talk to an LLM and do something more structured than one plain text response.",
      "hash": "c71face7e776d4d124bb4786f5ed475058b9096cbe5ae9ea85c99f2868f5a088"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba9bb6a0b9c92cf7034231f0303e6945efaa3db925320e058ea766280342c523",
      "text": "The common building blocks are:",
      "hash": "2d6b887c61efa27e3a9c74da08e99efdeac013f0a6edbbbafdb39db2b89f108b"
    },
    {
      "id": "644ddb1fc59c11a7bbeaf2c75d2c03b621ec2efec1a8e13a215fa34a59b103c0",
      "text": "streaming text back to the UI",
      "hash": "1bd72c70cc3ffe8f15af4a747cc89d751cdc4e8dd3fbb0cda9356144db29e6c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "779a2861212ec248df11bdd44548c411146cac22719d0c00313d387b9c19ad7a",
      "text": "asking for structured outputs",
      "hash": "e44654f0d39ac263f51aa2693caa0da74ce70954d21e25319ff0a6010e7c030c"
    },
    {
      "id": "9ce141e7860ae4a17764aa2b74d9d052bac4d8ac09b97bfc9363f26f04a65c62",
      "text": "calling tools from the model",
      "hash": "ab7a32dca0c865cba459bc5ca94833fcfe581d16b4e0d412a1e2b9ed0099e3a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb48af8fa890b45999efe994d24a0216de46a99900cc4bbe853615deafaee9b0",
      "text": "switching between model providers without rewriting the whole app",
      "hash": "b0a3dbd29dd8da2ba5f2d73476de1ce7c7a83f4090ac22b127c2f11643fe3203"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3835ae62505cccb60267fae7347844ac0202695659defe607ecd7b5310a4fa5",
      "text": "building agent-style flows where the model can take more than one step",
      "hash": "7530e2b820cea5f7ec9c520df641688d208733c485a0a8ceea08741448ae7353"
    },
    {
      "id": "4aad0c9dc59def8bc7b592187687a81d946795628365adb005d2758c0bf6cea8",
      "text": "That means the AI SDK is a good fit for chat interfaces, coding tools, workflow assistants, document tools, and internal agents.",
      "hash": "7dde62af42b2b43ec1ced5766a30c034062014b2c71f057b9b8daeb04ead8c14"
    },
    {
      "id": "6b86c261870551ed8e22107611344b958752633e8cc60926384fe8c870b001b9",
      "text": "If you want to go past the overview, the",
      "hash": "89521b191bf0e46a7910c0c6ff99353d295b9dc2d19b6d2dd21cfc81571ce19d"
    },
    {
      "id": "83703c0f429fd779c141e1a1d9997d67202fa2b443a81c6744e858e2e4827b2d",
      "text": "AI SDK v6 Crash Course",
      "hash": "71139c58dab0fc6fcc2f49d2d44fd5b7c9e9e6e7fbf043ec2f4b51758b1b82b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "66220391036fcd21538010c98f9de732b1175da4919fbe3d2c37a7a4eaadde62",
      "text": "walks through these pieces in a working app.",
      "hash": "3281214ce0ca122ef4d1cbd5978d75a3bd11b9ef6153ce4f2d42f8dec6753630"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9be01683a1e7d948a09f9f4770c04a7cc5e65dccaa4d4233600d72ee63170b4",
      "text": "This tutorial is only going to cover the core part of the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "d283e5091b89ed77950ea3ff16146036a0101f800db788e068bd7ee916a7d974"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e7d3d77cb4973184e8179928f7be71d23ef4e572e4f4bb9a647b6a05b300996",
      "text": "This is going to fill you in on the basics and give you the grounding that you need to build virtually anything.",
      "hash": "ca7d36327625e003d771d8b28560cc94e7bef0f040b880183ce0dd42504b5eeb"
    },
    {
      "id": "891098536f980c9761186fa195db5fb47d6470c887b661a6ff3e06e4cbb582c3",
      "text": "It has probably the best NPM package of all time -",
      "hash": "91d2c1d032580713b1f69e081d2cae76f87ac7906c355aae551d985e11e81338"
    },
    {
      "id": "d10c6cbf058f423e1749f08adeca84fd823d1fea437bc167f3ddb500ed7eaf44",
      "text": "All the core stuff is under the",
      "hash": "c00bb51b2d5b779c45ed97a0db2d9d441a531d93ad854b9a1d5b34639393ed09"
    },
    {
      "id": "968a7b6f2e04146b0d24e9ef490e341dac65ae305f2a02ac975446a36bfe8cc1",
      "text": "package:",
      "hash": "cb0569d12d8dcb090f74455652b1fc18edbce3df97de2c46080a72f629b8b47a"
    },
    {
      "id": "09bdb98583d620710743eec37d8d00ee02af6fdd632f38dd16623ee24efdf1ab",
      "text": "You can integrate with different providers by installing their specific package.",
      "hash": "2f6903229522bb6e4f1e6e232702305ebd43ffba1b10a1bcc50b5b68a17352f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "cf7bd10fb21f35b9a503419e8024518715810ce7681b2574f2c2969736462f0a",
      "text": "For instance, OpenAI:",
      "hash": "db2cf1d386eb1071c6045f9695430f43474aec99d17655edd8e6e8a99eeb1b3e"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ad86e0d32d515ffc9762e4afd4ee6f480007a7fc0cbad660c2e24a322c32f3a",
      "text": "And then you can use it like this:",
      "hash": "c5e456fbf929760106f15a493ca1030a3cd16af78f1347ff4186595fab7503f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8570a15b8abbbbff9253395844ce1b66912e8f8708a6b706d0b41e7490d06f0",
      "text": "So that's the lay of the land.",
      "hash": "56054a658db8c50873b47c035e910770ab6d3b3591fa2dd872c968fdc164d79c"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e23a9c65e4305ccccddcaf8de5a26380751dd97850c9d0fd2b266d37e4be294",
      "text": "You get a unified API where you can drop models in and out.",
      "hash": "a4a42a60a65e6e42d24e722862ee859dd118e9b8c596bacf6149bdb9b5cbf849"
    },
    {
      "id": "a16c57255ae8c648fb14fc1fdd9fd7ca13481a2b70ef89cb5fc118ca65680108",
      "text": "You can stream text, generate text, work with structured outputs, call tools, and build agentic loops.",
      "hash": "88ae487e435abfc53816671bb58b6827ac9887d5a4182a1bcf4cd77546778f19"
    },
    {
      "id": "b4b7c486205983e73a008a5155b0cf249688bea0e455fc5ad3650b58efcbd5ca",
      "text": "Let's start with the absolute basics: generate text. See you in the next one!",
      "hash": "34675d3be78e9fbf95e57c5152b1b40e3744c80fa1a0d2438b081b932613fc8b"
    },
    {
      "id": "53a0bd5549f70e4ca1028454711718169e3ba92b8148c7de1e79e8a9305a9f45",
      "text": "Go deeper",
      "hash": "6bce982b050c617bc1f5f68ea0ceea210a7979331fa96b8de8803cf5cd6861e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "8293ee87973c137c6de8a5fb91dcb76ddd912be7e7a0f2add7fc6142c79de0fd",
      "text": "Learn the AI SDK by building with it",
      "hash": "7690bc7f6b2f328813e0ef6880b10855f9f73aceeb9008b9e9c06e171940cdfc"
    },
    {
      "id": "013f09d80a780d569efd14d12b9529524f01fbe5f5a67226e70834033d79fb96",
      "text": "The AI SDK v6 crash course turns the concepts from this article into a working app with streaming, tools, and agents.",
      "hash": "e905fa6bb464e0065d44157895bf1e104a51c18a18988b39fb6119fe0fde9245"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff4ccb4e4ace445fb03c9a6ef3367020efcd072f141eef0ac4e0d73ffa4f390d",
      "text": "Start the AI SDK crash course",
      "hash": "92e1267dab155f46a71a373cc5c8c91c592b4d400e36c8c5685579b6792d7021"
    },
    {
      "id": "53e2737b3ba16eb34cf018bfb1adedb047414c1a413c8a289a97df005d0d8de0",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "2d5d1bdf78dfd84822259f0d50b2231e580130b1b0141dbcede86b43b58f6347",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "101c6018ef80f57ca6e38838ff3db57f9ffbd27987e100168b18e618629e23f1",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "2dc661f6837822cf13ee5ba00f8ba7382fe63a5d8cdbdc1ee48cec0aae3887b4",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "8985286327d6374f1373821f1a5f41ecafb340d73c34a15c1b453b4bc50d564f",
      "text": "Up next · lesson",
      "hash": "7915dcb8d2117c7a6a8fa6d5a1901ad5fa87b609352be8aca042d9a52d097c78"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd2cb07b71afba0a7008ccd12e1b3863e3be24d2de6c93d71c68171f7437d8cb",
      "text": "Log in",
      "hash": "c189840cf7e2d6f6fdeefde1ac59dfdf50bb75642eb569b4e38a5614d6f12ac2"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a136aaab8c76395489e25509361aef13c689d3386cae5cb2c45b16f2b625e6d",
      "text": "to save progress.",
      "hash": "80e970a1e5533be8e269820a64ae4280cb79d1ea60f31e0a89863e1ddd0aee48"
    },
    {
      "id": "df783d788e9d2ccee745fc0852db7a2dac9bc1523a7ae132aa08553f1f70a413",
      "text": "Learn",
      "hash": "ce78afd0e6a225ecac96a6812b9d192e7eb35889cd5237beb38b50375b79d8dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c3e2cb5b8f683ab32f16986a5f6d107fe542b15dab4571a2b83ff0cdf0fcff",
      "text": "The AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "0ecca41f97662f50fc4210f00b4d05ed73257d862ecbd642b906cd7da42d4092"
    },
    {
      "id": "550fc07215617b169421bc9f01b8473b469a96668cb2a51f8f4b218d1fc0d716",
      "text": "Model Context Protocol Tutorial",
      "hash": "d52bb57113ca725e4597402d041c46eaea7dad7dd40c1f6c374b03c1576d396e"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2d84d3444c999eb1ebf5ef1abf0098617a7b6a0a32a89e1dd2a596fc150d4b4",
      "text": "Cohorts",
      "hash": "e777d5967e8cd7d5430cf77dddcd2c67e54c6cdd955e18f1b7923733d09bff49"
    },
    {
      "id": "2d764f7ab69f82b0ac4cc677e4d9d169451f978c4eef287fba8e43ebba659fdd",
      "text": "AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "bfb5e9a9585215411729c3299f3518ae3dc543e956c197946e16be2ec2bc1d1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "d33596e22529fd2ec1f858491c576de6497088e39f23ba5c98a95ca60e2c47e4",
